{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ddddbdce4b38361c3b4122cf72e4de419a9305b6c8bc326a305eb0f28fb749f2", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。今日は\nレストランでの撮影とインタビューが控えている！）", "zh": "（照片杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄开始了。今天还要在餐厅进行拍摄和采访！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "f7ff55019f8599133503d9e45e205e641837d9427c31b622cb4b501eedcbc6e7", "ja": "これも美味しそうだし……あ、こっちも美味しそう！\nでもでもこっちも……ううっ、迷っちゃう～！", "zh": "这个看起来也很好吃……啊，这个看起来也很好吃！\n不过不过，这个也……呜呜，好纠结啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1002_p", "source_sha256": "249b37dabddfe52ce76a808a14dd56f105af1bb3864ce306f8faaebf955cf01e", "ja": "お疲れ様、未来。\nそんなに悩んでどうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，未来。\n怎么纠结成这样，发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "e2a24488764c81fc62bfa49f8d6af6c6aa904c1673172cf0f831a96c702e1da0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n助けてください！　メニューが決まらないんです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n请帮帮我！我决定不了要选什么菜单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0095ac8071137e0bd3c6b8b87dd94383b129e40e645f8cc2d0a52ee289b23b35", "ja": "メニュー……？\nもしかして、撮影で使う料理のことか？", "zh": "菜单……？\n难道是拍摄要用的料理吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "f8817b98094340f2b10786eb14d04f2fa603d4e5808cf7a953061663b999b9f4", "ja": "はい！　私が食べたいのでいいって言われたんですけど\n全部美味しそうで、決められないんです……！", "zh": "对！虽然他们说选我想吃的就行，可是看起来全都很好吃，我实在选不出来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1006_p", "source_sha256": "51480935f6c649b8dbfb5134ffffe52e3805c839fc0ecda1310db81b31973aac", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\n未来の食べたい物を全部、紹介するのはダメなのか？", "zh": "这、这样啊……  \n把未来想吃的东西全部介绍一遍，也不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "99ab221f56a7bc3f30642e1072d371758ac8e366b8f948cee10adb9d26d0ad40", "ja": "はい……スタッフさんに聞いたら、量が多くて\n載せられないって言われちゃいました……。", "zh": "是的……我问了工作人员，他们说想把这么多东西全都刊登上去，实在是放不下……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8ace936d29f97f6ad30a0338540961ffcaf2930a7f60c532cc1f62ffb0ab71b9", "ja": "それもそうか。でも豊富なメニューの中から\nひとつだけ選ぶのも……お、未来。これはどうだ？", "zh": "确实如此。不过，要从这么丰富的菜单里只选一个，也……哦，未来。这个怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "225cd7a0760e133b2efaf3546dcb3d5503f34a6771aacae8669e89409245dffd", "ja": "えーっと……お子様ランチを大人でも楽しめるように\nアレンジした『大人様ランチセット』……？", "zh": "呃……把儿童套餐改得连大人也能享用的“成人儿童套餐”……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "059a3cdb8c69846705605b23ee9ad4f8f85528d0930a5454aa47f4463ccf40ae", "ja": "わぁ～っ！　こんなのがあったんですね！　悩んでた\nメニューもいっぱい入ってるから、これなら……。", "zh": "哇～！原来还有这种东西啊！里面有好多我一直纠结的菜单，要是这个的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "d38b6b7e048f9a939978e05ac3b8dc064fd8bfbe480ad3d12ad269f774f3cd6b", "ja": "うう～……ダメです！　私、注文できません！", "zh": "呜呜～……不行！我点不了单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7ae721e04cd4db617bc6a5a98e51e54257e45efe9aca69e0ce3a5033f3e85142", "ja": "えっ！？　何か苦手なものが入ってたか？", "zh": "诶！？里面是不是有你不喜欢吃的东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "17272b2f931506259b782768ca5f94da4686bc35f8c18f1b01d82fc10379d5b9", "ja": "違うんです……。だってこれ、大人の人が食べるご飯\nですよね？　でも私、まだ大人じゃないから……。", "zh": "不是的……因为这个是大人吃的饭，对吧？可是我还不是大人，所以……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f5faf66b0790d9ecace86578571e6e201ae277ef8dfaaba32609336d25fa4800", "ja": "ははっ、それなら大丈夫だ。\n大人様ランチセットに年齢制限はないからな！", "zh": "哈哈，那就没问题了。\n大人儿童餐套餐没有年龄限制！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "12d72b331cd58225d311c89d10d14bbfc0637fe97d738e57fbd8fac10dc9071f", "ja": "ええ～！？　そうなんですか！？\nお子様ランチは小さい子しか頼めないのに……。", "zh": "诶——！？是这样吗！？\n明明儿童套餐只有小孩子才能点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1016_p", "source_sha256": "770ec17d41cba7cc18fadcff428d5d6fc9b2993bf34f654e09764a28c9b1be1f", "ja": "うーん……大人かどうかの判断は人それぞれだからな。\n自分が大人だと思えば、大丈夫……かな？", "zh": "嗯……毕竟每个人对是不是大人的判断都不一样。\n只要自己觉得是大人，应该就没问题……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "1e7b06d652870223fbac98bad2873229729406940501d76243a32b2d6028c222", "ja": "じゃあ「私、大人です！」って思いながら頼めば\n大丈夫ってことですね～！　よかった～♪", "zh": "那只要一边想着“我已经是大人了！”一边拜托，就没问题了吧～！太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "41e56013f00baf38d57a99ed4fcb00bbf7debb0bb607ed934e4236479ad3b92c", "ja": "これならインタビューで聞かれても、\nちゃんと答えられそうです。ありがとうございまーす！", "zh": "这样的话，就算在采访时被问到，应该也能好好回答了。谢谢你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0453_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3ddb61c9af526234cd2c1c2931153a482eded6a774e4e06e81eb98cd2c7a2a75", "ja": "（撮影もインタビューも無事終了。未来の『大人様\nランチセット』の声にお店の人も嬉しそうだったな）", "zh": "（拍摄和采访都顺利结束了。听到未来说出『大人尊享午餐套餐』，店里的人也很开心的样子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
